{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>She planned</b> — She considered buying a field." "<b>From the fruit of</b> — A hint at the wealth of her handiwork, that is: from the fruit of her hands she planted; a vineyard was planted for her, for it is not the way of women to plant."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:50.915758982Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}